	pkgdesc = Local AI image generation CLI — FLUX, SD3.5, SD 1.5, SDXL, Z-Image, Flux.2, Qwen-Image, Wuerstchen, LTX Video, & LTX-2 diffusion models on your GPU (built from source, CUDA)
